    "additive workflow import only",
    "workflow remains inactive after Gate 1",
    "existing credentials unchanged",
    "backup before mutation",
    "PostgreSQL/Supabase owns durable business state",
    "Gate 2 never edits pre-existing credentials",
    "Gate 2 never edits non-CASE003 workflows",
    "Supabase RPC stores only SHA-256 of the integration token",
    "CASE-003 remains inactive through Gate 2",
    "Gate 3 reuses the dedicated CASE-003 credential without editing credential payloads",
    "Gate 3 reserves notification keys in PostgreSQL before any delivery payload is allowed",
    "A duplicate reservation returns reserved=false and is filtered before delivery payload construction",
    "CASE-003 remains inactive through Gate 3",
    "Gate 3 contains no outbound messaging node",
    "Gate 4 never exposes raw XLSX columns directly to n8n",
    "Gate 4 verifies source provenance before canonical publication",
    "Gate 4 publication is atomic: candidate becomes active and previous active becomes superseded",
    "Gate 4 keeps PAYMENT_DATE_EVIDENCE distinct from certified paid/unpaid semantics",
    "Trigger split isolates Manual Trigger and Schedule Trigger into separate workflows",
